{"availability":"available","full":"Intugle/data-tools","name":"data-tools","description":"The GenAI-powered toolkit for automated data intelligence.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Jupyter Notebook","stars":152,"forks":46,"created":"2025-08-01T12:18:45Z","updated":"2026-09-08T08:24:39Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://intugle.github.io/data-tools/","topics":["data-analysis","data-catalog","data-discovery","data-science","developer-tools","generative-ai","python","semantic-layer","semantic-search"],"demo":"https://intugle.github.io/data-tools/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T13:35:13.321Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T13:35:13.321Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T13:35:13.321Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T13:35:13.321Z","stars":152,"forks":46}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The GenAI-powered toolkit for automated data intelligence.","Transform Fragmented Data into Connected Semantic Data Model","Intugle’s GenAI-powered open-source Python library builds a semantic data model over your existing data systems. At its core, it discovers meaningful links and relationships across data assets — enriching them with profiles, classifications, and business glossaries. With this connected knowledge layer, you can enable semantic search and auto-generate queries to create unified data products, making data integration and exploration faster, more accurate, and far less manual."],"features":["Semantic Data Model - Transform raw, fragmented datasets into an intelligent semantic graph that captures entities, relationships, and context — the foundation for connected intelligence.","Business Glossary & Semantic Search: Auto-generate a business glossary and enable search that understands meaning, not just keywords — making data more accessible across technical and business users.","Data Products - Instantly generate SQL and reusable data products enriched with context, eliminating manual pipelines and accelerating data-to-insight.","Conceptual Search - Generate data product plans from natural language queries, bridging the gap between business questions and executable data product definitions. Learn more in the documentation."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Intugle/data-tools/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2f4cde9e75328275e78b6a62980fefea89b6fd0714bc40bb928fee4c02f11c50","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T13:35:13.495Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T13:35:13.495Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The GenAI-powered toolkit for automated data intelligence.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Intugle/data-tools/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"2f4cde9e75328275e78b6a62980fefea89b6fd0714bc40bb928fee4c02f11c50","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Intugle/data-tools/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T13:35:13.496Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-08T08:24:39Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Intugle/data-tools/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T13:35:13.497Z","hash":"2f4cde9e75328275e78b6a62980fefea89b6fd0714bc40bb928fee4c02f11c50","originalBytes":16369,"storedBytes":16369,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["data","quickstart","semantic","search","notebooks","intugle","model","datasets","path","colab","business","please","streamlit","python","using","bash","install","name","csv","generate","products","see","documentation","native","relationships","type","across","app","build","connected","dataproduct","detailed","environment","fragmented","healthcare","layer","links","llm","product","queries","results","semanticmodel","server","tech","access","built","claims","composite","conceptual","create","databricks","databricks.ipynb","fmcg","following","layer.","library","license","macos","notebook","other","print","project","provider","refer","snowflake","snowflake.ipynb","these","unified","api","auto-generate","before","category","